Package: OncoStratify
Title: Interactive Kaplan-Meier Survival Stratification Tool
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("OncoStratify Team", email = "info@oncostratify.io", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A professional Shiny web application for interactive Kaplan-Meier survival analysis and biomarker discovery in cancer patients. Stratify patients by gene expression or clinical features and instantly visualize survival differences with statistical testing (log-rank, Cox model).
